  "content": "\n\n<h1><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Join our Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"加入我们的 Discord\"> </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\">\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Hiba550/Ore_Vein_Miner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/View on-GitHub-181717?logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"前往 GitHub 查看\"></a></p></h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n    \n# 矿脉开采器\n\n当你潜行时，使用镐子破坏一个相连的矿石方块，它会自动开采整个相连的矿脉。\n\n![1](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xl2GihRU/images/64ad1935bc25e006be50ed8fa4d9697da2639985.gif) \n![2](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xl2GihRU/images/1e1388588ccb36007b8137ce4584200f31626d17.gif)\n\n## 工作原理\n- 潜行（按住 Shift）并使用镐子开采任意矿石方块。整个相连的矿脉将被自动开采（**兼容精准采集**）\n\n## 注意事项\n- 当检测到装备附魔了**效率**时，会自动禁用矿脉开采功能",
